+- Modify: `src/store.mjs`
+- Modify: `test/app.test.mjs` (store-level tests via API, matching existing test style)
+
+**Interfaces:**
+- Produces: todo objects of shape `{ id, title, done, dueDate: string | null }`; `store.add({ title, dueDate? })` and `store.update(id, { dueDate? })` accept/validate `dueDate`.
+- Consumes: nothing new.
+
